The food looks like scrambled egg whites, pale with no yolk color, though it could also be paneer or tofu. The square plate is roughly 20–22 cm across, and the pile covers about 15 × 18 cm and is moderately heaped, which suggests about 200 g of food.

At an assumed 60–80 kcal per 100 g for egg whites cooked with a little oil, that gives roughly 150 kcal.

